WEBVTT

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:36.400
What do you think?

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.730
Hm. It's not bad.

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:40.480
Make arrangements for it to be framed.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:42.440
Yes, my lord.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:45.280
I guess I passed...?

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:48.650
Arte, I really like it.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.110
I'm looking forward to putting it up.

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:54.780
It's just as I expected. It's wonderful, Arte.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.980
You think so, too, don't you, Katarina?

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:03.070
You're finished... with all
the portraits now, right...?

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:11.280
Will you...?

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.320
Would you like to stay in Venice?

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:50.140
"Apprentice"

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:03.280
Leo.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:06.900
What color are you planning
to make these flowers?

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:10.610
I was planning to use a showy color,
like red or yellow.

00:03:10.610 --> 00:03:13.030
Please make them blue and purple.

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:15.320
Blue paint is expensive, you know.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:18.530
This painting is for a chest
going into my bedroom.

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:21.150
The gentlemen wouldn't be able to relax.

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:23.860
I will spare no expense.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:27.530
This is also an important tool of my trade.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:32.030
How's the church ceiling mural going?

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:34.690
Well, I'm managing somehow.

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:38.150
Have you heard from Arte?

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:40.820
Not really.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:46.400
Wasn't she supposed to be back in six months?
It's been more than that already, hasn't it?

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:49.610
Maybe she really likes Venice.

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:57.900
What, are you a thief?

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.570
Huh? Oh, no--

00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:08.650
I-I-I-I'm not! I'm not a thief or anything!

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:12.320
Hm? You used to come see Arte sometimes, huh?

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:14.530
Darcia, was it?

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:20.530
She-- Arte's not back yet.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.650
I see...

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:29.230
It's not like she's... not coming back... right?

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:31.190
Who knows?

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:36.730
Sooner or later, you will have
to leave this workshop

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:43.070
and get work with your own abilities
to put food on the table.

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:47.690
Think carefully about what I just
said when you're in Venice.

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:52.070
I think, if the result is that when you
finish your job in six months,

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:55.440
you don't come back here, that's fine, too.

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:08.070
Huh? For me?

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:11.190
Yes. He said his name was Matei...

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:13.400
Do you know him?

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:18.940
I wonder what he wants, coming so suddenly...

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:21.940
Um...

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:26.650
It's cold today, so I think it would be
best to let him come in quickly.

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:29.730
Oh, yeah, you're right.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:39.060
"Silence"

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:42.070
Um, sorry about my rudeness the other day--

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:44.150
I came to apologize to you.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:45.280
Huh?

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:53.190
I realized after what the young Lady Falier
said just how rude my words were...

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:58.860
I've been working here for years,
but I haven't caught anyone's eye yet.

00:05:58.860 --> 00:06:03.610
It's not just me. That's what
it's like for most apprentices.

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:09.650
You're from a noble family with an education,
and a rare female painter.

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:12.190
It really is wonderful.

00:06:12.190 --> 00:06:13.900
I'm envious.

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:19.320
With those words, it was as if I was saying
that you had no real talent.

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:21.280
I'm really very sorry.

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:23.900
U-Um, please don't worry about it.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:26.940
It's true that I'm a woman and a noble.

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:29.110
It doesn't bother me!

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:34.940
But didn't my words make you
take offense and worry?

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:37.480
No, they didn't.

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:42.610
You're a kind person.

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:45.690
That... Those words...

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:48.530
I couldn't help but feel envy that you seemed
to be progressing so smoothly

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:51.320
on your path to becoming a painter.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:54.190
It was ugly jealousy on my part.

00:06:56.730 --> 00:07:01.570
Actually, I'm often jealous of men.

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:04.610
"I wish I'd been born a boy, damn it"...

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:09.730
I've cursed like this inside my heart before.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:14.280
If your jealousy is ugly, then mine is, too.

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:18.610
So... please don't say that.

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:26.900
Oh, that's the portrait
of the lady of the house.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:30.480
Would you... let me see it?

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:38.650
Did you design the jewelry and lace yourself?

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:41.110
Huh? Y-Yes, I did.

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.030
Amazing...

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:47.110
Such soft lines, and a delicate touch.

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:52.570
It's my first time seeing a woman
look so lovely and beautiful...

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:58.570
I'm sorry. Honestly, I am jealous, after all.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:02.610
If this is because of your sensibilities
as a woman and a noble,

00:08:02.610 --> 00:08:05.860
then I cannot paint anything like it.

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:12.360
Arte, your gender, the place you were born,
the environment you grew up in--

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:15.280
Your talent includes all of that.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:20.730
Please treasure that talent
that makes me jealous.

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:23.940
I will.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:30.860
Leo, I've made my decision.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:35.230
I'm very grateful for the offer,

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:38.440
but I must refuse your offer
to let me stay here.

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:44.980
I see. What can I do?
This is the second time you've rejected me.

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:49.280
But for an apprentice painter,
this is an unprecedented offer.

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:52.570
I can't imagine that refusing
is the correct decision.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:53.900
Unless it's because

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:58.980
you still don't like that you were chosen
because you're a woman and a noble?

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:00.980
It's the opposite.

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:06.900
I realized that I have value because
I'm different as a woman and a noble.

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:09.780
You happened to notice that by chance.

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:15.610
But I don't want to leave it to chance.
I want to get work with my own power.

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:18.320
I believe that I have worth.

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:24.150
That's why, I'll return to Florence and
find customers even better than you.

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:35.190
I'll withdraw my offer then.
It appears I'm out of my depth.

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:41.070
It can't be helped. That's what
Katarina and I liked about you.

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:43.860
You treated me like small fry.

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:46.320
Make sure you catch a big fish.

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:50.360
No, that's not it! I didn't mean
to treat you like small fry!

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:53.030
Well, do your best.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:04.030
Katarina.

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:08.650
What is it?

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:12.320
Actually, I wanted to talk to you--

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:17.030
You're going home, right? I already knew that.
I don't want to hear any goodbyes.

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:19.650
I hate stuff like that.

00:10:20.690 --> 00:10:24.320
Yeah, me, too.

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:28.860
I hate goodbyes. We're the same.

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:31.230
There are two things I wanted to talk about.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:36.070
The first thing is about the other day,
when you got mad for my sake.

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:38.530
You can't change your birth either.

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:42.480
Even if someone says they're jealous. Right?

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:45.980
Thanks to what you taught me
and your pushing me,

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:49.070
I was able to decide what I should do.

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:50.980
Thanks.

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:53.690
And the other thing is a favor
I'd like to ask of you.

00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:59.230
I'd like you to be my friend from now on.

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:03.440
I'll write lots and lots of letters
to you as your friend.

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:07.610
And I want lots and lots
of letters from you, too.

00:11:07.610 --> 00:11:09.730
F-Friend...?

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:12.440
That's right! Friends!

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:21.650
Make sure you write a lot of letters.

00:11:21.650 --> 00:11:25.150
You, too, Katarina. I'm looking forward to them!

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:30.480
Now, I need to make a bunch of preparations.

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:32.570
Sorry to interrupt you.

00:11:32.570 --> 00:11:34.030
Arte!

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:39.730
I... really like the portrait.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:42.570
I'll cherish it.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:46.730
I am honored that you like it, my lady.

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:06.570
I'll cherish it...

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:12.530
It's my treasure.

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:20.780
Almost...

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:29.780
I'm almost back in Florence...

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.690
Just a little further...

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:42.400
I'm finally back.

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:45.360
Leo!

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:54.530
What should I tell Leo...?

00:12:56.570 --> 00:12:58.320
For now...

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:05.400
Leo, I'm later than I planned, but I'm back!

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:10.400
Huh? Leo?

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:14.070
Leo!

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:15.780
Arte!

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:18.610
Darcia? What are you doing here?

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:21.280
Did you come back because you heard about Leo?

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:23.650
Huh? Did something happen to Leo?

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:28.190
You don't know? Leo's had a fever for days...

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:30.230
He hasn't woken up...

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:33.900
Where is he?

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.360
He's at Ubertino's place right now.

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:40.610
That's why I was asked to come
and get a change of clothes.

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:42.070
Leo!

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:49.030
Oh, you're back, girl?

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:52.530
Mr. Ubertino! Where's Leo?

00:13:52.530 --> 00:13:54.400
He's sleeping in the detached room.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:56.900
Um, how is he?

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:59.780
He's not dead, anyway.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:03.480
Oh, good...

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:10.400
More than his health, what I'm
worried about is the ceiling mural.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:11.820
Ceiling mural?

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:15.730
I commissioned a church ceiling mural from him.

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:19.980
It needs to be completed by Easter, but...

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.280
Wow...

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:36.320
Leo's sketches are amazing.

00:14:36.320 --> 00:14:40.530
But there's still so much that
hasn't been painted in yet.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:44.860
There's less than a week before Easter.

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:54.900
Um... Will you let me do the rest?

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:58.730
I don't know if I can paint
what Leo was planning to paint,

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:01.780
but I <i>am</i> a member of his workshop.

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:05.780
I want to finish the job our workshop took on.

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.400
But...

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:13.360
Please! I'll start right now
so I can finish by Easter!

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:16.780
Please!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:25.030
Leo's drawings really are amazing.

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:27.530
A divine and dignified Virgin Mary...

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:31.400
But she has a very soft expression,

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:35.570
one that watches over everyone
and envelops them...

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:41.110
Even when I was in Venice,
I was so encouraged by that altarpiece.

00:15:41.110 --> 00:15:43.860
I want more people to see his work.

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:47.400
That's why I'll finish this no matter what!

00:15:56.730 --> 00:15:59.360
Oh, no! I need to paint!

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:37.190
Girl, are you okay?

00:16:38.900 --> 00:16:41.320
Mr. Ubertino...

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:44.150
Three days left until Easter...

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:47.570
Can you finish it like that?

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:54.400
At the pace I'm going,
it'll take another five days...

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:56.820
It's true that at this rate...

00:16:57.820 --> 00:16:59.360
Arte!

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:06.440
Why didn't you tell me that you came back?!

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:08.030
Sorry...

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:12.610
Anyway, I'm glad... I thought you
weren't going to come back anymore.

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:16.110
Well, shall we get back to work?

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:17.030
Huh?

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:18.440
I'll help, too.

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:19.480
But--

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:22.940
I got permission from Master Danilo.

00:17:22.940 --> 00:17:27.150
When I asked him, he asked <i>me</i>
why I didn't come sooner.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:32.110
Let's make sure we finish this before Easter!

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.070
Yeah!

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:35.030
Arte!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:36.780
I brought food!

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.280
Darcia!

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:41.320
Veronica told me to bring it.

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:47.780
I'm cheering you on, too!

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:49.150
Thanks!

00:17:57.940 --> 00:18:00.860
Oh, you're working!

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:02.820
We came to help, too!

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:03.690
Huh?

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:08.280
We can't do anything until we finish
the work from our workshops, though.

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:10.690
Let us help!

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:14.570
Everyone... Thank you!

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:23.150
Arte, rest a bit.

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:24.570
No, I'm fine.

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:27.860
At least wipe your face. There's paint on it.

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:29.030
Huh?

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:02.110
We made it somehow, huh?

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:08.780
All of it's been painted,
but I wonder if it's how Leo wanted it...

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:13.440
I wonder if he'll get mad if he sees it...

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:16.070
Who painted the rest for me?!

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:30.190
You still can't calculate the lighting properly.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:34.530
The light hits differently in
the morning and in the evening.

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:37.820
You need to think about that
when you paint the colors in.

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:42.440
He's right. I should've made
that part a little darker.

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:44.610
I'll fix the colors later.

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:45.610
Oh, right!

00:19:45.610 --> 00:19:47.820
Is that a Venetian-style embellishment?

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:49.610
U-Um...

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:53.150
It's not bad.

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:56.360
It looks like you didn't go there for nothing.

00:19:58.150 --> 00:20:02.780
But I thought you weren't coming back anymore.

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:04.570
Leo!

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:06.860
Going to Venice made me realize

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:11.980
that I want to paint paintings that
encourage people, like you do!

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:15.530
That's why I want to keep studying under you.

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:19.280
I want you to teach me more
and more different things.

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.780
Arte...

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:27.940
I'm going to keep working in your
workshop, as your apprentice!

00:20:27.940 --> 00:20:30.730
I'm counting on you from now on, too.

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:40.980
Yes, sir!

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:53.650
Hm, well, this turned out well.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:55.480
Better than expected.

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:57.400
It's wonderful.

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:03.650
There must be a kindness and innocence
inside you that you don't let show.

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:07.940
Now, I wonder what I should
commission from you next...

00:21:07.940 --> 00:21:13.150
Arte's back now, too, so anything goes, right?

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:18.280
Apparently, Lady Arte also
helped complete this mural.

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:25.610
This mural... Arte...

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:27.530
Mother.

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:29.110
Arte.

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:33.190
Thank you for coming today.

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:37.730
I thought a woman's only choices were
to get married or to become a nun.

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:40.480
But it looks like you're making do somehow.

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:44.150
Mother, did you notice?

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:47.820
You and Father are there.

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:54.360
I did the people on the edges.

00:21:54.360 --> 00:21:58.940
All the people important
to me are in that mural.

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:11.570
They're all people who added color to my life.

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:21.440
Katarina, how are you?

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:25.860
I'm working busily from morning until night.

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:29.650
But I'm having fun doing what I love.

00:22:29.650 --> 00:22:33.360
I hope you're able to do what you love, too.

00:22:35.230 --> 00:22:39.320
Katarina, we need to start preparing soon.

00:22:39.320 --> 00:22:44.030
You're cooking a celebratory meal for
your mother's birthday today, right?

00:22:44.030 --> 00:22:45.440
Yes.

00:22:46.530 --> 00:22:48.030
Is that from Arte?

00:22:48.030 --> 00:22:50.110
Yes.

00:22:50.110 --> 00:22:55.400
Uncle Yuri, I want to visit Florence someday.

00:22:55.400 --> 00:23:00.280
And I want to see a lot of Arte's paintings.

00:23:00.280 --> 00:23:03.860
Yeah, I want to see them, too.
